      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Inclusion Criteria: Study Type: Original pediatric studies, including cohort studies, case-control studies, and randomized or nonrandomized interventional studies. ... Population: Pediatric patients (<18 years) undergoing ERCP. Outcomes: Reported incidence, types, risk factors, or management strategies of post-ERCP complications. Language: English. Publication Date: January 1, 2015 to June 26, 2025.",
      "reason": "The evidence specifies key eligibility components for determining study inclusion (study type, population, outcomes, language, and publication date range), but it does not clearly specify follow-up requirements."
    },
