      "reason": "The evidence indicates that proportions were logit-transformed for the meta-analysis of PEP incidence, and pooled results are presented as incidence/pooled proportions; however, it does not describe a full method for re-expressing synthesized results into another effect measure beyond this transformation/presentation."
